  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "i recently changed my router and it has a feature to block alot of various things and apparently something my router is now blocking for privacy is causing vrchat to send me into the Error world saying \"Unusual Client Behavior\" and it becomes really annoying trying to work on a world when that happens since it makes using the \"World Reload\" stop working due to being taken to the error world instead of just trying to rejoin that client into the Offline instance.\n\ni feel like the error world simply shouldn't exist for Offline mode because all that does is annoy creators when it happens.\n\nif i want to fix this for myself/ make going into the error world happen alot less i will have to disable these privacy features and that is something i dont want to do as its the entire reason why i switched routers and afaik i cant just unblock vrchat from this.",
